    "lyrics": {
      "text": "Now am I at rest,_______ and have found__ great__ re-lease; for I have been trans-lat-ed from__ cor-rup--tion, and have passed o-ver in-to life. Lord, glo--ry be__ to__ Thee. \n\nNow have I chos---en_______ the Maid-en Moth--er__ of God; for Christ, the__ Re-deem--er of all men was born of her. Lord,__ glo-ry be to Thee.____"
